N5008 [dcl.init.list]/5-6, [expr.const]/11, [expr.add], [expr.eq]: a
constexpr function over a std::initializer_list argument.  Non-vacuous: the
last assertion is deliberately wrong and must FAIL.  Before the fix every
static_assert here was "could not be evaluated".
